<workout_file>
    <author>Domestique Library</author>
    <name>Neuromuscular 30s/5min 4x (38min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 7min ramp from 45% to 75% FTP, 3 x 30s fast-pedal drill @ 82%, primer 1min @ 88% + 1min @ 102% | Sprint-shaped anaerobic capacity: 4 x (30s @ 182% / 5min @ 45%) | Cooldown: 5min 30s from 65% to 45% FTP</description>
